WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.880
One agent kicks

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:01.440
data out of

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:02.100
the cache,

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.580
the other

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.800
times it's reads,

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.480
fast,

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.740
slow, fast.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:06.780
That's a message.
